{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/employee-lose-sponsor-licence","content_id":"ffc38be3-f9bb-4920-a180-79926dfd21a9","description":"What happens if you're a sponsored employee and your sponsor loses their licence, has a suspended licence","details":{"body":"<p>You’ll have to leave your job and leave the UK if your employer loses their sponsor licence - unless you make a new visa application to stay in the UK.</p>\n\n<p>You could also be affected if:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>their licence is suspended</li>\n  <li>they’re taken over</li>\n  <li>they do not renew their licence</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>What happens to you depends on whether you’re already in the UK when your employer’s sponsor licence changes.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"if-youre-already-in-the-uk\">If you’re already in the UK</h2>\n\n<p>When your sponsor loses their licence your:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>certificate of sponsorship is cancelled</li>\n  <li>visa is limited to 60 days (or however long you have left on the visa if it’s less than 60 days)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>You’ll have to leave your job and leave the UK unless you make a new visa application within that time - <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/browse/visas-immigration\">check your eligibility for visas</a>.</p>\n\n<div role=\"note\" aria-label=\"Information\" class=\"application-notice info-notice\">\n  <p>If you’re involved in the reasons why your sponsor lost their licence, your visa will be withdrawn and you’ll have to leave the UK immediately.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3 id=\"if-your-sponsors-licence-is-suspended\">If your sponsor’s licence is suspended</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Your circumstances</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">What will happen</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Travelled to the UK but have not started work</td>\n      <td>You can start work</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Already working</td>\n      <td>You can keep working</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Applied to extend your visa</td>\n      <td>Your application will not be processed until the suspension ends</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"if-youre-outside-the-uk\">If you’re outside the UK</h2>\n\n<p>Check the status of your sponsor’s licence on the <a href=\"/government/publications/register-of-licensed-sponsors-workers\">register of sponsors</a> before you travel - your sponsor will not be listed if they’ve lost their licence or it’s suspended.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"if-your-sponsor-loses-their-licence\">If your sponsor loses their licence</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Your circumstances</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">What will happen</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Applied for a visa</td>\n      <td>It will be refused</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Have a visa but have not travelled to the UK</td>\n      <td>Your visa will be cancelled - you will not be allowed to enter if you travel to the UK</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"if-your-sponsors-licence-is-suspended-1\">If your sponsor’s licence is suspended</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Your circumstances</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">What will happen</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Applied for a visa</td>\n      <td>Your application will be put on hold until the end of the suspension</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Have a visa but have not travelled to the UK</td>\n      <td>You’ll be contacted by UK Visas and Immigration (<abbr title=\"UK Visas and Immigration\">UKVI</abbr>)</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"if-your-sponsors-business-is-taken-over-or-they-do-not-renew-their-licence\">If your sponsor’s business is taken over or they do not renew their licence</h2>\n\n<p>Your visa will be limited to 60 days (or however long you have left on the visa if it’s less than 60 days) if:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>your employer does not renew their sponsor licence</li>\n  <li>following a takeover of your old employer’s business, your new employer does not apply for a sponsor licence within 28 days</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>You’ll have to leave your job and leave the UK unless you make a new visa application within that time - <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/browse/visas-immigration\">check your eligibility for visas</a>.</p>\n\n<div role=\"note\" aria-label=\"Information\" class=\"application-notice info-notice\">\n  <p>Your visa will be cancelled if you have permission to come to the UK but have not travelled yet. You will not be allowed to enter if you travel to the UK.</p>\n</div>\n\n","external_related_links":[]},"document_type":"answer","first_published_at":"2014-02-05T15:33:58+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/employee-lose-sponsor-licence","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/employee-lose-sponsor-licence","base_path":"/employee-lose-sponsor-licence","content_id":"ffc38be3-f9bb-4920-a180-79926dfd21a9","document_type":"answer","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2015-12-18T18:11:22Z","schema_name":"answer","title":"Employees: if your visa sponsor loses their licence","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/employee-lose-sponsor-licence","withdrawn":false}],"mainstream_browse_pages":[{"api_path":"/api/content/browse/visas-immigration/work-visas","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/browse/visas-immigration/work-visas","base_path":"/browse/visas-immigration/work-visas","content_id":"4ab4764d-d9ce-425f-a8cc-aaba4a38be09","description":"Skilled Worker visa, Graduate visa, other work visas, right to work","document_type":"mainstream_browse_page","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-01-02T10:04:23Z","schema_name":"mainstream_browse_page","title":"Work in the UK","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/browse/visas-immigration/work-visas","withdrawn":false}],"ordered_related_items":[{"api_path":"/api/content/student-sponsor-loses-licence","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/student-sponsor-loses-licence","b